<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">The Optimization=
 Benefits</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">This partitioning provides sever=
al key advantages:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Efficiency</stro=
ng>: Variables are only stored in contexts where they're actually needed</l=
i>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cache Locality</strong>=
: Related variables are stored together</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Garbage Collection Effi=
ciency</strong>: Unused contexts can be collected independently</li>
</ol>
